  "text": "Chopsticks | Rickie Cheuk 24cm(l) x 0.6cm(w) – Steel – £45 This exquisite pair of chopsticks is handcrafted by Ricky Cheuk in his London Studio. Created from metal reclaimed from an old sink salvaged during the demolition of a London residential home. Ricky melted down the salvaged material and meticulously carved and polished each chopstick, resulting in a pair that is not only visually striking but also perfectly balanced in the hand. The smooth, tactile finish and subtle weight distribution elevate everyday use into a mindful, sensory experience. A functional object with a rich narrative, these chopsticks are as meaningful as they are beautiful. Enquire now First & Last Name Email Phone Message Send Related Artworks Chess Set by Jacob Chan Stillness by Zahed Tajeddin Conical Bowl by Louis Vincent Teoju by Jihyun Kim",
